---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Mauricio Meza — mechanical designer and mechatronics engineer bridging precision manufacturing with robotics."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">

    <!-- Avatar + Name -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6 mb-12">
      <div
        class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 teal-ring"
        style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1623 0%, #0f2235 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.2);"
      >
        <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight"
          style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2dd4bf, #67e8f9); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;">
          MM
        </span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary tracking-tight">Mauricio Meza</h1>
        <p class="text-sm font-mono text-bright mt-1">Mechanical Designer · Mechatronics Engineer · Phoenix, AZ</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Career arc -->
    <div class="mb-14 space-y-4 text-base text-muted-2 leading-relaxed max-w-prose">
      <p>
        I started as an electrical engineering graduate from ITESCA in Mexico — BSEE in Mechatronics, class of 2013 —
        and spent the next decade working across automation, controls, and eventually precision mechanical design.
        The work that stuck was physical: designing the fixtures that hold parts at the right angle,
        the assemblies that absorb vibration without failing, the tooling that keeps a manufacturing line running.
      </p>
      <p>
        After moving to Phoenix, I built seven years of industrial design experience across HVAC, aerospace,
        retail display, and emergency response industries. I hold a CSWP certification and have shipped
        designs that went into production — not just simulations. Along the way I kept pulling at the
        robotics and autonomy thread: ROS 2, Python, control theory, perception.
      </p>
      <p>
        Now I'm closing the loop. I'm preparing my application to ASU's MS Robotics & Autonomous Systems
        program (EE concentration, target Spring 2027) — not as a career pivot, but as the logical next
        step for an engineer who has always been interested in what happens when mechanical systems
        start to move on their own.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Education -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <p class="section-label mb-5">Education</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="bg-surface border border-white/[0.07] rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-bright/20 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary">MS Robotics &amp; Autonomous Systems</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted-2 mt-0.5">Arizona State University — EE concentration</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-accent bg-accent/[0.08] border border-accent/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Planned 2027</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface border border-white/[0.07] rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-bright/20 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary">BSEE — Mechatronics Engineering</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted-2 mt-0.5">ITESCA, Mexico</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-muted">2013</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Certifications -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <p class="section-label mb-5">Certifications</p>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-4 bg-surface border border-white/[0.07] rounded-xl px-5 py-4 hover:border-bright/20 transition-colors duration-300">
        <img src="/images/cswp-badge.svg" alt="CSWP" class="h-9 w-9 object-contain" />
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary">Certified SolidWorks Professional (CSWP)</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-accent mt-0.5">Dassault Systèmes</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Skills grid -->
    <div>
      <p class="section-label mb-5">Skills</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {[
          {
            label: 'Mechanical Design',
            color: 'text-bright',
            items: ['SolidWorks (CSWP)', 'AutoCAD', 'GD&T', 'FEA / Simulation', 'Fixture & Tooling Design', 'Sheet Metal', 'Design Tables'],
          },
          {
            label: 'Electrical / Controls',
            color: 'text-bright',
            items: ['PLC Programming', 'Mechatronics', 'Automation', 'Sensors & Actuators', 'Circuit Design'],
          },
          {
            label: 'Software',
            color: 'text-bright',
            items: ['Python', 'NumPy / SciPy', 'OpenCV', 'PyTorch', 'Git', 'Linux'],
          },
          {
            label: 'Robotics',
            color: 'text-bright',
            items: ['ROS 2', 'Control Theory', 'Kinematics', 'Point Cloud Processing (PCL)', 'LiDAR / Depth Sensors'],
          },
        ].map(({ label, items }) => (
          <div class="bg-surface border border-white/[0.07] rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-bright/20 transition-colors duration-300">
            <h3 class="text-[10px] font-mono text-accent uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">{label}</h3>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
              {items.map(s => (
                <li class="text-sm text-muted-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent/50 flex-shrink-0" />
                  {s}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>
</BaseLayout>
